{"id":"wb-8-49","name":"壳丘头遗址群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"壳丘头遗址群","text":"壳丘头遗址群是位于中华人民共和国福建省福州市平潭县苏平镇的数个古遗址，历史时代为距今7500年—3000年的新石器时代至商朝时期。壳丘头遗址群首次发现于1958年，由壳丘头、西营、东花丘、龟山等地的遗址组成，被认为是南岛语族早期人种向台湾以及南太平洋地区扩散的发源地，对南岛语族的起源与迁徙研究具有一定价值。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A3%B3%E4%B8%98%E5%A4%B4%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":94779078,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94779078","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/44971b5d1685546539d89d60.jpg","title":"壳丘头遗址博物馆第一展厅_06.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A3%B3%E4%B8%98%E5%A4%B4%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%B1%95%E5%8E%85_06.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/%E5%A3%B3%E4%B8%98%E5%A4%B4%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%B1%95%E5%8E%85_06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"FradonStar","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​壳丘头遗址博物馆第一展厅“向海而生——平潭史前文化”展览内容","width":320,"height":240}}